00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:06,000
There's a new way to be wicked.

2
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:06,000
Descendants: The Rise of Red is a fantasy, adventure,
family film directed by Jennifer Phang.

3
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,000
After the Queen of Hearts incites a coup on Auradon, her rebellious daughter Red and Cinderella's perfectionist daughter Chloe join
forces and travel back in time to try to undo the traumatic event that set Red's mother down her villainous path.

4
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:06,000
Princess Red, played by Kylie Cantrall.

5
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
Chloe, played by Malia Baker.

6
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:06,000
Bridget, played by Ruby Rose Turner.

7
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:06,000
Ella, played by Morgan Dudley.

8
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:06,000
Uliana, played by Dara Reneé.

9
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:06,000
Queen of Hearts, played by Rita Ora.

10
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
Descendants: The Rise of Red is a 2024 American musical teen fantasy comedy film
directed by Jennifer Phang from a screenplay by Dan Frey and Ru Sommer.

11
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,000
Produced by Disney Channel, the film is the fourth installment in the Descendants franchise, being a
spin-off of the previous three films and a follow-up from Descendants: The Royal Wedding (2021).

12
00:48:00,000 --> 00:48:06,000
The film was released on Disney+ on July 12, 2024, and made
its debut on Disney Channel on August 9, 2024.

13
00:52:00,000 --> 00:52:06,000
Kylie Cantrall and Malia Baker star as Red (daughter of Queen of Hearts from Alice in Wonderland) and
Chloe Charming (daughter of Cinderella and Prince Charming from Cinderella), respectively.

14
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
China Anne McClain and Melanie Paxson reprise their roles of Uma and Fairy
Godmother, respectively, from previous Descendants films.

15
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
Cinderella and King Charming are played by Brandy and Paolo Montalban, who previously played
versions of the characters in the 1997 television adaptation of Cinderella.

16
01:04:00,000 --> 01:04:06,000
Descendants: The Rise of Red received generally mixed reviews from critics.

17
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
With 6.7 million views in its first three days of streaming, the film broke a record in its debut on
Disney+ as Disney Branded Television's most-viewed premiere ever on the platform.

18
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
The film later demonstrated substantial streaming viewership, leading as the top streaming original
movie for a week and maintaining strong rankings throughout July and early August 2024.

19
01:16:00,000 --> 01:16:06,000
It became Disney+'s most-streamed live-action
original movie since Hocus Pocus 2.

20
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
A sequel, Descendants: Wicked Wonderland, is scheduled for release in 2026.

21
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
The film explores themes of descendant, time
travel, musical, spin off, cinderella.

22
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:06,000
The tone is lighthearted.
